    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d324">

                <pb facs="0396" n="326" xml:id="pg326"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 185.1/14</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic"> Major General F. J. Kernan to the Secretary of the
                        Commission to Negotiate Peace</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1919-01-12">12 January,
                            1919</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1. Herewith are two copies of a memorandum I am submitting for the American
                    Commission to Negotiate Peace. This memorandum was drawn up by me after a
                    conference with Mr. D. H. Miller and Major J. B. Scott, to whom I am also
                    sending copies.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">F. J. Kernan</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Major General, U. S. A.</hi>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d324-a1.xml" xpointer="d324-a1"/>
            </div>
